{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"MCP recurrence on 2026-09-04: during grouped-comment ticket migration, transition_ticket timed out at the 300-second tools/call deadline after only a six-ticket, two-worker pilot. Readback showed the preceding supersedes links persisted, but both source tickets remained open, so no close was ambiguous. The local CLI fallback is being used for the remaining migration. This broadens the observed impact from canceled-search starvation to mutation availability after sustained MCP load."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788573635320118001,"uuid":"d45e4f88-0510-4a31-9f72-28a24e918fa7"}